{"seq":64,"slug":"data-compression-algorithms","title":"数据压缩算法","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数据压缩算法\n\n把同样的信息塞进更少的比特，是计算机科学里最朴素也最深刻的命题之一。每一次网页加载、每一张手机照片、每一个数据库列、每一段视频流，背后都站着一套压缩算法在替我们省下带宽、磁盘和时间。这个 hub 想讲清楚的，不是「怎么调用 gzip」，而是这些算法到底在做什么、为什么它们能起作用、又为什么它们各有各的极限。\n\n整个 hub 按四条主线层层递进，每一章都建立在前一章的概念之上。\n\n第一章「基础」铺设地基。它从信息论的视角回答一个先决问题：压缩为什么可能？答案藏在「冗余」里——数据中可预测、可重复、可省略的那一部分。我们会引入香农的信源编码定理，把熵确立为压缩比的理论下界，并厘清无损与有损这条贯穿全 hub 的分水岭。读完这一章，你会拥有衡量后续所有算法好坏的统一尺子。\n\n第二章「熵编码」处理一个被前一章逼出来的问题：既然熵是下界，怎样的编码才能逼近它？霍夫曼编码给出整数比特的最优前缀码，算术编码与 ANS 则突破整数比特的限制、真正贴近熵，而游程编码则处理最朴素的一类冗余。这一章是把信息论从「能压到多少」变成「怎么压到那么多」的桥梁。\n\n第三章「字典与变换」转向另一类冗余：重复的字符串。LZ 家族用滑动窗口和字典捕捉重复，BWT 用一次巧妙的排列让数据变得更可压，而 zstd、brotli 这些现代压缩器则把字典匹配与熵编码缝合成工业级流水线。这一章解释了你日常用到的几乎所有通用压缩工具的内核。\n\n第四章「专用与应用」是落地收口。它走出通用压缩，进入图像、音频这类允许有损、靠人类感知冗余取胜的领域，进入列式存储这类靠数据布局取胜的数据库场景，最后用一篇选型与权衡把全 hub 的算法放进同一张决策表里——告诉你在真实工程里，面对延迟、比特率、CPU 预算时该怎么选。\n\n四章读下来，你会从「压缩为什么可能」一路走到「这个具体场景该用哪个算法、为什么」。建议按顺序阅读，但每篇文档都自带交叉链接，遇到前置概念可随时跳回去补课。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compression-basics","title":"压缩的本质与信息论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/compression-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"entropy-redundancy","title":"熵与冗余","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/entropy-redundancy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lossless-vs-lossy","title":"无损与有损压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/lossless-vs-lossy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"entropy-coding","title":"熵编码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"huffman-coding","title":"霍夫曼编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/huffman-coding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"arithmetic-coding-ans","title":"算术编码与 ANS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans"},{"seq":3,"slug":"run-length","title":"游程编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/run-length"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dictionary","title":"字典与变换","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/dictionary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lz77-lz78-lzw","title":"LZ77、LZ78 与 LZW","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/dictionary/lz77-lz78-lzw"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bwt-transform","title":"BWT 与 MTF 变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/dictionary/bwt-transform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-compressors","title":"现代压缩器：zstd 与 brotli","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/dictionary/modern-compressors"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"specialized","title":"专用与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/specialized","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"image-audio-compression","title":"图像与音频有损压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/specialized/image-audio-compression"},{"seq":2,"slug":"columnar-compression","title":"列式与数据库压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/specialized/columnar-compression"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compression-tradeoffs","title":"压缩选型与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/specialized/compression-tradeoffs"}]}]}